			"Message": "feat(Cocoon): add multi-alias support and timeout handling for ESM import interception\n\n- Expanded ESM loader hook to intercept 'land' alias alongside 'vscode', enabling extension compatibility with alternative specifiers\n- Implemented 5-second timeout for main thread resolution requests to prevent loader thread hangs during extension bootstrap\n- Enhanced MessagePort communication with request ID tracking and cleanup logic to handle abandoned promises\n- Added detailed JSDoc annotations explaining hook architecture and alignment with Cocoon's extension shimming strategy\n- Improved error logging and fallback to default resolution when main thread communication fails\n- Introduced structured pending request map with timeout IDs to prevent memory leaks in long-running processes\n\nThis strengthens extension host reliability by ensuring consistent API access regardless of import alias while maintaining loader thread responsiveness through robust timeout handling.",
