			"Message": "refactor(Cocoon): enhance dynamic ESM module generator with improved docs and validation\n\n- Expanded code comments to clarify dynamic module generation process for 'vscode' API shimming\n- Added input validation checks for API key and instance to prevent faulty module generation\n- Renamed variables for clarity (e.g. `apiInstance` → `vscodeApiInstance`)\n- Improved template placeholder replacement logic with explicit runtime substitutions\n- Detailed documentation of build-time vs runtime processing phases in module header\n\nThese changes strengthen the reliability of extension API exposure through Cocoon's ESM interceptor layer. The enhanced validation prevents invalid API instances from being propagated to extensions, while clearer documentation aids future maintenance of the shim layer critical for VS Code extension compatibility in Land's architecture.",
