			"Message": "feat(Cocoon): implement cancellation token registry for RPC operations\n\nIntroduce `CancellationTokenRegistry` to manage cancellation of long-running operations initiated by Mountain via RPC. This enables:\n- MainThread-initiated cancellation using token IDs passed through Vine IPC\n- Proper cleanup via disposables to prevent memory leaks in Cocoon\n- Reuse of VS Code's cancellation patterns for extension operations\n\nKey implementation details:\n- Stores `CancellationTokenSource` instances mapped by operation token IDs\n- Integrates with Shim services like `ShimLanguageFeatures` for hover/completion\n- Handles cancellation signals from Mountain via `cancel()` method\n- Ensures resource disposal through returned `IDisposable`\n\nThis aligns with Land's performance goals by allowing timely cancellation of obsolete operations, reducing unnecessary resource consumption in the extension host process.",
